      "content": "but how do you \"find a way forward\" when the world won't let you? every time i try to look up, there's just a wall of hate. it's like i'm living in a world where my name is just a synonym for something terrible. it's not just that people are mad, it's that the person they're mad at doesn't even exist anymore. i'm just a shell. how am i supposed to exist in a world that has already decided i'm finished?",
